{"id":"20ce4fc55dd53d44","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-ground-horn-calculus.md","title":"闭Horn规则的有限证明演算","display":"df-ground-horn-calculus — 闭Horn规则的有限证明演算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-ground-horn-calculus","aliases":["72-df-ground-horn-calculus"],"display":"df-ground-horn-calculus — 闭Horn规则的有限证明演算","depends_on":["[[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local finitary proof interface for the definite fragment of Ch.IX §§2.6,4","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-ground-horn-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-ground-horn-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground-horn-calculus — 闭Horn规则的有限证明演算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3a4858795b9c601\" href=\"?note=f3a4858795b9c601\" title=\"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator\">72-df-definite-herbrand-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local finitary proof interface for the definite fragment of Ch.IX §§2.6,4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\operatorname{Gr}(P),\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\">\\(P,\\operatorname{Gr}(P),\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3a4858795b9c601\" href=\"?note=f3a4858795b9c601\" title=\"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator\">72-df-definite-herbrand-operator</a>；固定规则标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{horn}\\ne\\mathsf{ax}\">\\(\\mathsf{horn}\\ne\\mathsf{ax}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>带标签实例和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C},\\operatorname{Concl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C},\\operatorname{Concl}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的任意结论集合版本；这里结论集合为闭原子，不把它们识别为相继式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R_P^H&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{horn},\\langle A,B\\rangle,B,A\\rangle:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Gr}(P)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_P&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,\\varnothing,\\mathsf R_P^H\\rangle,\\\\\nP\\vdash_H A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal H_P}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R_P^H&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{horn},\\langle A,B\\rangle,B,A\\rangle:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Gr}(P)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_P&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,\\varnothing,\\mathsf R_P^H\\rangle,\\\\\nP\\vdash_H A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal H_P}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>事实子句是空前提规则，不作为另外的非逻辑公理节点。规则见证保存完整闭子句，前提序列保留其体次序。通用证明树允许任意给定判断集合，因此可以直接使用已有树编码；没有为语义兼容而伪造新的相继式语法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator","status":"resolved","id":"f3a4858795b9c601","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator","status":"resolved","id":"f3a4858795b9c601","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\operatorname{Gr}(P),\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]；固定规则标签 $\\mathsf{horn}\\ne\\mathsf{ax}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"带标签实例和 $\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C},\\operatorname{Concl}$ 取 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的任意结论集合版本；这里结论集合为闭原子，不把它们识别为相继式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\operatorname{Gr}(P),\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{horn}\\ne\\mathsf{ax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C},\\operatorname{Concl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R_P^H&:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{horn},\\langle A,B\\rangle,B,A\\rangle:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Gr}(P)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_P&:=\\langle\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,\\varnothing,\\mathsf R_P^H\\rangle,\\\\\nP\\vdash_H A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal H_P}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1793,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-436","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-ground-horn-calculus|df-ground-horn-calculus — 闭Horn规则的有限证明演算]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-426","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"闭Horn证明演算：[[72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-403","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-ground-horn-calculus|df-ground-horn-calculus — 闭Horn规则的有限证明演算]]"},{"id":"6fa80b05609c7b74","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,\\mathcal H_P$、$P\\vdash_H A$ 取 [[72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]；$I_n,I_\\omega$ 取 [[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]"}],"outgoing":["f3a4858795b9c601","81c9c855e009a6d4"]}